WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.040 --> 00:02.240
This series was created for entertainment purposes.

3
00:02.240 --> 00:05.680
The characters, actions, locations, dialogue, languages, ceremonies,

4
00:05.680 --> 00:08.120
and artistic elements depicted in this series

5
00:08.120 --> 00:10.040
are fictional and based on imagination,

6
00:10.040 --> 00:13.920
incorporating the beauty of the region's diverse cultures,

7
00:13.920 --> 00:18.400
including those of Lanna, Myanmar, the Tai peoples, and China.

8
00:18.400 --> 00:20.560
It is not intended to disrespect any history,

9
00:20.560 --> 00:23.600
ethnic group, organization, profession, or group of individuals.

10
00:23.600 --> 00:26.040
Viewer discretion is advised.

11
00:26.040 --> 00:27.880
[Previously] The King has issued a royal decree

12
00:27.880 --> 00:29.800
appointing Lady Fongnuan

13
00:29.800 --> 00:33.040
as a lady-in-waiting in the outer court of Wiang Kaew.

14
00:33.040 --> 00:36.080
It was me, Homjan. I had you summoned to Wiang Kaew.

15
00:36.080 --> 00:39.920
I wish to know everything about Maneethip, especially her past.

16
00:39.920 --> 00:41.560
Is something wrong?

17
00:41.560 --> 00:45.240
I'll order the soldiers to bring the bandits' bodies back to Ullavee.

18
00:45.240 --> 00:48.440
I want to investigate and find out who was behind this.

19
00:48.440 --> 00:50.040
Take the bodies away for cremation.

20
00:50.040 --> 00:51.800
I don't know anything about court duties.

21
00:51.800 --> 00:53.240
I'll teach you.

22
00:53.240 --> 00:56.640
Come here tomorrow to begin your training.

23
00:56.640 --> 00:58.480
Tomorrow?

24
00:58.480 --> 00:59.720
Yes.

25
01:06.600 --> 01:09.280
- Add a little more firewood. - Yes, Your Highness.

26
01:16.240 --> 01:18.880
You never seem to learn.

27
01:19.520 --> 01:23.600
You must be careful when wrapping Miang. It's not something you can rush.

28
01:36.960 --> 01:42.040
Wrap the Miang tightly so the filling doesn't fall out.

29
01:42.040 --> 01:43.880
Yes, Your Highness.

30
02:04.360 --> 02:08.680
Your Highness! Blood! Blood!

31
02:08.680 --> 02:10.920
- Blood! - Your Highness!

32
02:11.880 --> 02:13.280
Are you hurt?

33
02:13.280 --> 02:14.960
- Blood! - Your Highness!

34
02:15.880 --> 02:18.120
- Your Highness! - Your Highness!

35
02:18.120 --> 02:21.560
- Blood! - You're bleeding, Your Highness!

36
02:24.520 --> 02:25.800
- Blood! Your Highness! - Blood! Your Highness!

37
02:25.800 --> 02:26.840
Blood! Your Highness!

38
02:26.840 --> 02:28.680
Your Highness!

39
02:31.680 --> 02:33.280
Your Highness!

40
02:46.720 --> 02:48.080
Your Highness.

41
02:48.920 --> 02:54.160
- Your Highness! Your Highness! Your Highness! - Your Highness! Your Highness! Your Highness!

42
03:01.440 --> 03:02.840
I'm sorry.

43
03:03.440 --> 03:07.840
I couldn't protect you or our child.

44
03:53.120 --> 03:55.360
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

45
03:57.120 --> 04:00.320
But I no longer wish to be a royal consort.

46
04:01.640 --> 04:05.960
Please let me live as an ordinary lady-in-waiting...

47
04:05.960 --> 04:09.240
and serve you here in Wiang Kaew.

48
04:19.680 --> 04:21.600
If that is what you wish,

49
04:22.840 --> 04:24.480
so be it.

50
04:28.840 --> 04:31.640
I shall appoint you Head Lady-in-Waiting,

51
04:33.160 --> 04:35.680
to oversee all the ladies-in-waiting...

52
04:36.760 --> 04:39.680
in both the Outer and Inner Courts.

53
04:45.080 --> 04:47.240
But you must stay by my side...

54
04:48.520 --> 04:50.080
for the rest of your life.

55
05:01.520 --> 05:05.000
Whoever poisoned my child...

56
05:06.440 --> 05:10.040
will suffer a terrible fate.

57
07:08.800 --> 07:18.720
[Irresistible Feelings]

58
07:19.240 --> 07:20.960
When speaking to the King,

59
07:20.960 --> 07:23.600
use the proper pronoun for yourself.

60
07:23.600 --> 07:29.120
The same applies when speaking to royals of either the Outer or Inner Court.

61
07:30.040 --> 07:31.680
Do you understand?

62
07:32.440 --> 07:34.160
Yes, my lady!

63
07:36.520 --> 07:40.480
Lower your voice. Don't sound so commanding.

64
07:40.480 --> 07:42.800
You're not a soldier.

65
07:42.800 --> 07:45.080
And don't show your teeth when you smile.

66
07:46.120 --> 07:47.760
It's improper.

67
07:48.720 --> 07:51.520
- Yes, my lady. - Too slow.

68
07:51.520 --> 07:53.840
- Answer at the right pace. - Yes, my lady.

69
07:56.680 --> 08:01.800
In the King's presence, sit properly and avoid looking directly at him.

70
08:01.800 --> 08:04.480
Keep your eyes on the floor, three cubits ahead of you.

71
08:04.480 --> 08:07.800
Keep your hands folded in front of you, where the King can see them.

72
08:07.800 --> 08:10.000
Three cubits?

73
08:10.000 --> 08:12.120
How am I supposed to see anything?

74
08:28.800 --> 08:31.360
This is how you must sit. Remember it.

75
08:31.360 --> 08:33.200
Yes, my lady.

76
08:33.200 --> 08:37.640
When presenting something to the King, you must move only forward or backward.

77
08:37.640 --> 08:41.640
Never turn your back on him. Don't stomp your feet.

78
08:41.640 --> 08:46.320
Keep your steps light and measured. Neither too fast nor too slow.

79
08:49.440 --> 08:52.440
Too fast. Start again.

80
09:02.560 --> 09:04.080
Too slow.

81
09:05.200 --> 09:06.560
Start again.

82
09:11.000 --> 09:14.040
Then how fast am I supposed to walk, my lady?

83
09:38.160 --> 09:39.520
Oops!

84
09:40.760 --> 09:42.320
Goodness gracious!

85
09:44.560 --> 09:45.880
Start again.

86
10:08.040 --> 10:09.760
Did I pass, my lady?

87
10:11.720 --> 10:13.120
Try again.

88
10:58.000 --> 10:59.640
You are all dismissed.

89
11:06.280 --> 11:09.880
I found rice from Ullavee in Merng Mang's granary.

90
11:19.160 --> 11:22.680
All rice looks alike.

91
11:23.800 --> 11:28.040
I've tasted rice from Ullavee and Merng Mang.

92
11:28.040 --> 11:30.920
I can tell the difference even with my eyes closed.

93
11:33.520 --> 11:35.920
If you won't confess,

94
11:35.920 --> 11:41.400
I'll tell the King that the four thieves you had cremated...

95
11:41.400 --> 11:44.800
were actually your own soldiers.

96
11:45.800 --> 11:51.720
You staged the whole theft to steal rice from Ullavee.

97
11:55.240 --> 11:59.840
You've got nothing but a sack of rice, and you dare accuse me?

98
12:00.560 --> 12:05.160
How convenient. What a shameless lie! How could those thieves have been my soldiers?

99
12:05.160 --> 12:08.040
Their bodies bore the tattoos of Merng Mang soldiers.

100
12:08.800 --> 12:14.040
I doubt your soldiers would be pleased to learn you killed your own men.

101
12:14.040 --> 12:16.480
Just to cover up your lies.

102
12:16.480 --> 12:18.800
Confess now,

103
12:19.480 --> 12:24.720
or I'll bring your soldiers before the King and expose the truth.

104
12:24.720 --> 12:26.160
Your choice!

105
12:28.880 --> 12:30.000
I...

106
12:32.080 --> 12:33.880
choose to silence you!

107
12:39.560 --> 12:43.280
You're on Merng Mang soil. You think you can threaten me here?

108
12:43.920 --> 12:45.520
I'm not threatening you.

109
12:52.800 --> 12:55.320
I know you've been exiled.

110
12:55.920 --> 12:58.920
You need somewhere to stay.

111
12:58.920 --> 13:01.240
Why not join me?

112
13:01.240 --> 13:03.760
I'll make sure you're well looked after, Mueang Fah.

113
13:03.760 --> 13:05.760
I have no intention of staying in Merng Mang!

114
13:07.720 --> 13:12.480
I won't mention the rice,

115
13:12.480 --> 13:15.240
the soldiers' bodies, or the fake bandits.

116
13:16.040 --> 13:21.000
But you must tell Indraraja exactly what I instruct you to say.

117
13:26.240 --> 13:31.200
You should send Mueang Fah to serve in the King's Guard at Wiang Kaew.

118
13:32.840 --> 13:34.160
Why?

119
13:34.160 --> 13:36.280
I've heard...

120
13:36.280 --> 13:40.960
more people are growing suspicious of our extortion of caravan merchants.

121
13:41.800 --> 13:46.000
If we put Mueang Fah in Wiang Kaew as our eyes and ears,

122
13:46.000 --> 13:51.680
he can keep us informed and keep the King in the dark.

123
13:53.080 --> 13:55.480
I see your point,

124
13:55.480 --> 13:57.960
but Mueang Fah was born during the Hour of the Plunderer.

125
13:57.960 --> 14:00.400
He is destined to bring disaster upon the kingdom.

126
14:00.400 --> 14:03.480
Father would never allow him to live in Wiang Kaew.

127
14:07.040 --> 14:08.640
I have a plan.

128
14:43.240 --> 14:45.840
You have all come here today.

129
14:45.840 --> 14:47.760
What brings you here?

130
14:50.440 --> 14:56.440
The drought has driven bandits to raid the borderlands for rice.

131
14:56.440 --> 14:59.520
They may even dare to raid the Royal Granary.

132
15:01.240 --> 15:03.840
I fear for your safety, Father.

133
15:05.120 --> 15:08.120
I therefore ask you to issue a royal decree...

134
15:09.080 --> 15:13.120
appointing Mueang Fah to the King's Guard at Wiang Kaew.

135
15:13.120 --> 15:15.080
Why must it be Mueang Fah?

136
15:15.920 --> 15:19.360
Mueang Fah is a skilled fighter. Everyone knows that.

137
15:19.360 --> 15:23.960
He has fought bandits along the borders. He knows all their tricks.

138
15:23.960 --> 15:25.800
With him here,

139
15:25.800 --> 15:30.520
I'm certain he can protect both you and Wiang Kaew.

140
15:35.960 --> 15:38.880
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

141
15:38.880 --> 15:43.080
Prince Mueang Fah is a formidable warrior.

142
15:43.080 --> 15:48.480
He has fought countless bandits along the borders.

143
15:48.480 --> 15:50.720
With him protecting Your Majesty,

144
15:50.720 --> 15:55.360
Wiang Kaew will be much safer.

145
15:57.760 --> 15:59.320
But what about the prophecy?

146
16:04.600 --> 16:08.080
I've studied Ullavee's fortunes for this period.

147
16:08.080 --> 16:13.200
Our kingdom remains strong, Your Majesty.

148
16:13.200 --> 16:18.600
Prince Mueang Fah's fate poses no danger to Ullavee.

149
16:27.480 --> 16:29.080
Father,

150
16:30.760 --> 16:35.280
I allowed Mueang Fah to stay in Ullavee some time ago.

151
16:35.280 --> 16:38.560
Nothing troubling has happened since.

152
16:38.560 --> 16:44.520
Perhaps his hour of birth has no effect on Ullavee after all.

153
16:49.440 --> 16:51.520
If you all insist,

154
16:52.280 --> 16:54.080
I shall grant your request.

155
16:54.920 --> 16:58.000
Mueang Fah may come to Wiang Kaew.

156
16:58.920 --> 17:04.840
But once the bandits are dealt with, he must return to Merng Mang, the border city.

157
17:14.760 --> 17:16.920
I did as you asked.

158
17:16.920 --> 17:18.640
Now keep your end of the bargain.

159
17:19.560 --> 17:21.720
I'm a man of my word.

160
17:21.720 --> 17:23.560
I keep my promises.

161
17:24.920 --> 17:27.400
If you tell anyone,

162
17:27.400 --> 17:32.320
I'll have a grave dug for you deep in the forests of Merng Mang.

163
17:32.320 --> 17:36.000
You'll never live to return to Ullavee.

164
17:58.720 --> 18:02.880
In Wiang Kaew, there are two groups of ladies-in-waiting.

165
18:04.240 --> 18:05.880
Outer Court ladies-in-waiting...

166
18:05.880 --> 18:10.160
attend to the Royal Palace, Royal Residence, Royal Library,

167
18:10.160 --> 18:13.080
and the residences of male royals.

168
18:13.080 --> 18:16.120
Inner Court ladies-in-waiting attend to the Royal Kitchen,

169
18:16.120 --> 18:22.240
the Herb Room, the Fragrance Room, and the residences of female royals.

170
18:22.240 --> 18:25.920
All ladies-in-waiting are under my supervision.

171
18:25.920 --> 18:31.240
All ladies-in-waiting must perform their duties from dawn until dusk.

172
18:31.240 --> 18:37.200
You must rise before sunrise and carry out all your duties.

173
18:39.680 --> 18:43.440
From now on, you must watch your every move.

174
18:43.440 --> 18:46.960
Mind your manners, your words, and your gestures.

175
18:46.960 --> 18:50.120
Remember everything I've taught you.

176
18:50.120 --> 18:54.880
There is one rule more important than serving the King himself.

177
18:59.720 --> 19:02.680
Never reveal the Royal Residence's secrets.

178
19:02.680 --> 19:04.960
Do not wander about at night.

179
19:04.960 --> 19:09.520
Do not pry into anything you overhear.

180
19:09.520 --> 19:11.480
Do you understand?

181
19:11.480 --> 19:13.520
Yes, my lady.

182
19:13.520 --> 19:14.760
Good.

183
19:16.560 --> 19:18.560
Serving the King isn't all you'll do.

184
19:18.560 --> 19:22.200
You must also study the subjects that interest him.

185
19:22.200 --> 19:28.560
These include literature, music, statecraft, and warfare.

186
19:28.560 --> 19:31.080
Will you teach me all of that, my lady?

187
19:32.920 --> 19:37.440
You'll have to learn on your own.

188
19:42.440 --> 19:44.800
Where am I supposed to learn all that?

189
19:59.480 --> 20:02.880
May I ask you a favor, Your Highnesses?

190
20:02.880 --> 20:04.560
That pronoun...

191
20:04.560 --> 20:06.320
Why are you calling yourself that?

192
20:06.320 --> 20:08.640
You needn't be so formal with us.

193
20:08.640 --> 20:10.360
Those were Lady Homjan's instructions.

194
20:10.360 --> 20:15.680
At Wiang Kaew, I must use that pronoun when speaking to a prince.

195
20:15.680 --> 20:17.640
Just speak to us as you always have.

196
20:18.480 --> 20:20.640
We're not at Wiang Kaew.

197
20:20.640 --> 20:22.600
I can't, Your Highness.

198
20:22.600 --> 20:27.400
If I accidentally use the wrong pronoun,

199
20:27.400 --> 20:31.120
I could lose my head, Your Highness.

200
20:31.120 --> 20:36.240
Fongnuan, enough with the formalities. You're giving me a headache.

201
20:37.080 --> 20:41.200
Use whichever pronoun feels natural to you.

202
20:42.480 --> 20:46.160
Anyway, what did you need our help with?

203
20:46.920 --> 20:49.960
I need to learn about His Majesty's interests.

204
20:49.960 --> 20:53.400
Literature, music,

205
20:53.400 --> 20:57.040
statecraft, and warfare.

206
20:57.040 --> 21:01.400
I thought you two might be able to teach me.

207
21:01.400 --> 21:03.120
- Of course. - Of course.

208
21:03.120 --> 21:04.840
That's great!

209
21:10.160 --> 21:12.960
What can each of you teach me, Your Highnesses?

210
21:27.480 --> 21:31.040
If you'd been born 200 years later,

211
21:31.040 --> 21:34.000
you could've become a music star.

212
21:34.000 --> 21:35.440
What?

213
21:35.440 --> 21:41.360
I mean, you're talented enough to be a professional musician.

214
21:42.760 --> 21:43.880
This is the Royal Library.

215
21:43.880 --> 21:47.320
You'll find plenty of records on governance and trade here.

216
21:47.320 --> 21:49.800
They'll help you understand Ullavee better.

217
21:52.240 --> 21:57.160
Then let me ask you something. Who is Ullavee's queen now?

218
21:58.840 --> 22:02.920
After Queen Chao Oun, Indraraja's mother, passed away,

219
22:02.920 --> 22:05.560
Father never appointed another queen.

220
22:05.560 --> 22:07.800
Well...

221
22:08.480 --> 22:11.640
What about your mother and Prince Fah Haam's?

222
22:11.640 --> 22:15.840
I haven't seen either of them since I arrived in Ullavee.

223
22:19.560 --> 22:21.560
Royal Consort Saeng Nguean,

224
22:22.760 --> 22:27.280
my mother, disappeared when I was young.

225
22:28.640 --> 22:33.440
Royal Consort In Kaew, Fah Haam's mother,

226
22:33.440 --> 22:36.520
died shortly after he was born.

227
22:40.280 --> 22:43.280
I'm sorry I asked, Your Highness.

228
22:43.280 --> 22:45.480
It's all right, Fongnuan.

229
22:46.800 --> 22:49.080
I'm ready to learn, Senior.

230
22:49.080 --> 22:52.720
Jerng is more than just a martial art.

231
22:52.720 --> 22:54.640
It also requires focus.

232
22:55.440 --> 22:57.840
Your mind and body must move as one.

233
22:57.840 --> 23:01.200
Your hands and feet must work together.

234
23:01.200 --> 23:03.880
Keep your stance firm and your strides steady.

235
23:03.880 --> 23:05.480
Strides?

236
23:05.480 --> 23:09.040
A stride is one of the basic movements in martial arts.

237
23:09.040 --> 23:12.040
Step slowly but firmly.

238
23:12.040 --> 23:14.120
It helps you keep your balance.

239
23:14.120 --> 23:18.720
If your footing is off, your opponent will have an opening to strike.

240
23:20.040 --> 23:21.520
Strum harder.

241
23:31.960 --> 23:36.680
I've learned so much in just one day. Soon I'll be better than you!

242
23:44.040 --> 23:48.000
I told you to stand firm. Chest up!

243
23:48.000 --> 23:50.600
What about trade, Your Highness? Salt, for example.

244
23:50.600 --> 23:56.400
Sister Maneethip told me Ullavee and Wang Nam Lin developed close ties

245
23:56.400 --> 23:59.320
because Wang Nam Lin produces so much salt.

246
23:59.320 --> 24:01.520
Have I passed now?

247
24:02.440 --> 24:06.240
- Listen to this. - There. That's the sound of my heart.

248
24:07.960 --> 24:08.840
Doesn't it sound lovely, Your Highness?

249
24:08.840 --> 24:11.360
- Ullavee. - Ullavee.

250
24:11.360 --> 24:12.560
Wang Nam Lin.

251
24:12.560 --> 24:14.600
- That's where the salt fields are. - Yes.

252
24:14.600 --> 24:17.280
The military camps...

253
24:17.280 --> 24:20.040
The east. The west.

254
24:20.040 --> 24:22.920
Merng Mang. And the borders.

255
24:24.280 --> 24:27.360
It sounds better the longer I listen.

256
24:28.800 --> 24:31.120
Then play it for Father.

257
24:36.760 --> 24:38.880
I'm exhausted.

258
24:38.880 --> 24:41.000
You're going too fast, Senior.

259
24:41.000 --> 24:43.480
- Work on your strides. Stride. - Senior!

260
24:45.400 --> 24:47.160
Good heavens!

261
25:07.880 --> 25:09.240
Your turn.

262
25:16.720 --> 25:18.360
Move your fingers like this.

263
25:36.560 --> 25:39.080
Why are you only teaching her sad songs, Your Highness?

264
25:45.360 --> 25:48.880
My name is Bua Sai. I'm the music troupe leader's daughter.

265
25:48.880 --> 25:51.960
We're performing at the City Longevity Ceremony.

266
25:51.960 --> 25:55.280
I see. I'm Fongnuan.

267
25:57.400 --> 25:59.440
All these sad songs...

268
25:59.440 --> 26:04.400
I wonder if her teacher has had his heart broken.

269
26:06.360 --> 26:08.880
I'd like to learn some cheerful songs, too.

270
26:08.880 --> 26:12.120
- Could you teach me, Bua Sai? - No.

271
26:12.120 --> 26:14.560
A student shouldn't have too many teachers.

272
26:17.480 --> 26:21.640
Lady Fongnuan, you should learn from Prince Fah Haam.

273
26:21.640 --> 26:24.680
I can teach you cheerful songs another time.

274
26:36.040 --> 26:37.280
Let's continue.

275
26:39.160 --> 26:40.640
Excuse me a moment.

276
26:42.120 --> 26:45.440
Hey! Prince Fah Haam!

277
26:45.440 --> 26:47.880
I've only learned one note!

278
26:50.320 --> 26:54.040
Wait! My lady.

279
26:54.040 --> 26:55.400
Hold on.

280
26:56.600 --> 26:57.840
My lady.

281
27:00.640 --> 27:03.240
I haven't even told you my name.

282
27:03.240 --> 27:05.880
How did you know I'm Prince Fah Haam?

283
27:06.640 --> 27:09.160
I know more than just your name.

284
27:09.160 --> 27:13.520
I also know why your music sounds so sorrowful.

285
27:15.920 --> 27:18.400
You still haven't forgotten Nam Nang.

286
27:19.240 --> 27:20.920
How did you know?

287
27:22.240 --> 27:24.560
Nam Nang is a close friend of mine.

288
27:34.440 --> 27:35.920
So...

289
27:36.760 --> 27:40.480
What did she say about me?

290
27:42.000 --> 27:46.080
She didn't say much about you. She told me why she was angry.

291
27:46.080 --> 27:49.080
You were a prince all along.

292
27:49.760 --> 27:52.240
You never told her the truth.

293
27:53.840 --> 27:58.400
I understand how she feels, but I see things differently.

294
28:00.520 --> 28:03.320
I don't mind that you're a prince.

295
28:03.960 --> 28:06.200
But I can't stand liars.

296
28:08.320 --> 28:13.800
Love built on lies can never last, Your Highness.

297
28:19.800 --> 28:23.760
Forgive me for speaking so bluntly.

298
28:24.480 --> 28:26.640
I hope you won't take offense.

299
28:29.360 --> 28:33.440
And don't think I've fallen for you.

300
28:34.760 --> 28:39.320
At least not yet.

301
29:05.440 --> 29:06.840
Jom Harn.

302
29:13.280 --> 29:15.840
Have you heard about your father and brother?

303
29:17.240 --> 29:21.560
I have. You should be happy for Mueang Fah, Mother.

304
29:23.400 --> 29:26.080
I suspect Indraraja is plotting something.

305
29:27.360 --> 29:30.240
He's placed Mueang Fah right by your father's side.

306
29:31.280 --> 29:35.280
He must be using your brother to spy on everything at Wiang Kaew.

307
29:38.760 --> 29:43.120
Or perhaps Indraraja is worried he might lose his title.

308
29:44.760 --> 29:48.720
Word has spread throughout the city that he's been illegally collecting tribute.

309
29:48.720 --> 29:51.240
Perhaps he's using your brother

310
29:51.240 --> 29:54.920
to stop the caravan merchants from petitioning your father.

311
29:55.680 --> 29:57.680
- Mother-- - Or perhaps...

312
29:59.440 --> 30:03.000
he plans to replace Muen In with your brother?

313
30:03.000 --> 30:05.440
Build his army? Prove his worth?

314
30:07.160 --> 30:08.560
Or could he be...

315
30:10.080 --> 30:13.040
plotting to assassinate the King?

316
30:14.240 --> 30:16.080
Good heavens, Mother!

317
30:16.800 --> 30:20.960
Mueang Fah would never harm Father!

318
30:22.200 --> 30:26.760
My brother isn't so easily manipulated.

319
30:26.760 --> 30:30.520
He only sided with Indraraja because he wanted to come home.

320
30:30.520 --> 30:32.640
He wants to return to Ullavee.

321
30:33.760 --> 30:35.840
You know that.

322
30:41.920 --> 30:44.560
Don't look at me as though it's my fault.

323
30:45.480 --> 30:48.680
Your brother was born during the Hour of the Plunderer.

324
30:48.680 --> 30:51.400
That's why he was exiled to the border and forbidden to return to Ullavee.

325
30:51.400 --> 30:55.240
Yet Indraraja managed to change Father's mind.

326
30:57.040 --> 31:02.200
If you'd stood up for Mueang Fah back then, he would be here with us now.

327
31:06.800 --> 31:10.160
I've never believed in the Hour of the Plunderer.

328
31:10.160 --> 31:12.600
Mueang Fah has been back in Ullavee for some time.

329
31:12.600 --> 31:15.080
Father hasn't shown any concern.

330
31:16.640 --> 31:21.720
The only person who's troubled by it is you, Mother.

331
31:44.280 --> 31:46.800
You've finally returned to Wiang Kaew.

332
31:47.640 --> 31:49.240
But...

333
31:50.360 --> 31:53.040
my stay is only temporary, Your Highness.

334
31:53.040 --> 31:55.400
I'll do everything I can to win Father's approval,

335
31:56.240 --> 31:59.320
so I can stay in Ullavee for good.

336
32:02.440 --> 32:08.400
I'll determine an auspicious time for you to enter Wiang Kaew...

337
32:08.400 --> 32:10.440
without any trouble.

338
32:12.400 --> 32:14.520
An auspicious time?

339
32:15.840 --> 32:17.640
The Hour of the Ruler.

340
32:19.840 --> 32:23.840
It's an auspicious time to receive a new title.

341
32:23.840 --> 32:27.080
If you enter Wiang Kaew at that hour,

342
32:27.080 --> 32:30.200
great fortune will await you,

343
32:30.200 --> 32:34.800
along with power and honor.

344
32:37.000 --> 32:42.360
Once you're in Wiang Kaew, you must be very careful.

345
32:42.360 --> 32:47.360
Don't put yourself in danger or those you hold dear.

346
32:48.400 --> 32:51.040
I've always been careful.

347
33:05.040 --> 33:08.720
Wiang Kaew is more than the King's residence.

348
33:08.720 --> 33:14.200
Everyone there must fight to survive.

349
33:14.200 --> 33:17.520
It offers great rewards, but also great dangers.

350
33:17.520 --> 33:22.640
Your abilities alone won't be enough to survive there.

351
33:22.640 --> 33:25.520
You'll need to use your wits.

352
33:26.520 --> 33:28.360
So think carefully.

353
33:29.200 --> 33:32.920
Don't do anything reckless.

354
33:32.920 --> 33:37.080
Others could suffer the consequences of your actions.

355
33:38.200 --> 33:42.560
Your sister, Saen Thep,

356
33:44.480 --> 33:48.440
and I could all be dragged into trouble.

357
33:49.480 --> 33:51.160
Do you understand?

358
33:51.960 --> 33:53.640
Yes, Your Highness.

359
33:53.640 --> 33:57.440
Mother is right. You must be careful.

360
33:58.520 --> 34:01.280
But Lady Homjan chose you to serve at Wiang Kaew.

361
34:01.280 --> 34:03.480
I'm sure she'll look after you.

362
34:04.320 --> 34:06.200
Can she really be trusted?

363
34:07.760 --> 34:12.000
You can't trust anyone at Wiang Kaew.

364
34:14.680 --> 34:18.320
Now hurry, or you'll be late.

365
34:31.120 --> 34:32.600
Maneethip.

366
34:35.760 --> 34:40.480
Whatever path you choose, keep your thoughts pure,

367
34:40.480 --> 34:44.440
speak kindly, and do good deeds.

368
34:44.440 --> 34:46.560
Never wish harm upon anyone,

369
34:47.840 --> 34:50.360
and your good deeds will protect you.

370
34:51.400 --> 34:53.560
I'll remember that.

371
34:57.360 --> 35:02.240
Lha, if anything happens,

372
35:02.240 --> 35:04.600
send word to me immediately.

373
35:04.600 --> 35:06.440
I'll return at once.

374
35:07.160 --> 35:08.520
Yes, my lady.

375
35:15.000 --> 35:17.960
Lady Fongnuan, please take good care of yourself.

376
35:45.000 --> 35:48.760
You may have pushed your way into Wiang Kaew today,

377
35:48.760 --> 35:51.560
but don't think you'll get any further than that.

378
35:52.880 --> 35:57.520
I don't want to be in Wiang Kaew, but I have no choice.

379
35:58.440 --> 36:00.880
You claim you have no choice,

380
36:00.880 --> 36:05.400
yet you chose to place yourself near my father.

381
36:07.360 --> 36:11.160
I only do what I must to survive.

382
36:11.160 --> 36:16.160
You know Ullavee is not a place where people are free to choose how they live.

383
36:16.840 --> 36:21.520
Even you, the King's own daughter, cannot choose your own fate.

384
36:21.520 --> 36:23.640
- What a sharp tongue! - Go ahead, Your Highness.

385
36:24.640 --> 36:27.320
Slap me, then explain to the King...

386
36:27.320 --> 36:31.840
why you struck his outer-court lady-in-waiting.

387
36:31.840 --> 36:33.560
Hit me hard.

388
36:33.560 --> 36:38.160
Better yet, leave a mark on my face, so there's clear evidence of what happened.

389
36:45.040 --> 36:47.800
You haven't even set foot in Wiang Kaew,

390
36:48.640 --> 36:50.760
yet you're already so insolent.

391
36:50.760 --> 36:56.640
I'll wait and see how long someone like you can survive in there.

392
37:00.120 --> 37:02.280
Do whatever you wish.

393
37:03.200 --> 37:04.920
If you'll excuse me, Your Highness.

394
37:28.840 --> 37:32.640
- Junior. - Hey, Senior.

395
37:32.640 --> 37:36.160
I was just about to visit you at Saen Thep's residence.

396
37:36.160 --> 37:39.080
So, where are you headed?

397
37:42.240 --> 37:43.920
Wiang Kaew.

398
37:47.720 --> 37:49.240
Senior.

399
37:50.480 --> 37:52.920
What are you going to warn me about?

400
37:52.920 --> 37:56.120
I haven't even entered Wiang Kaew, and I'm already frightened.

401
37:56.120 --> 37:59.280
Junior. Don't be afraid.

402
37:59.280 --> 38:01.560
I'm not here to warn you.

403
38:01.560 --> 38:03.280
I'm just here...

404
38:04.960 --> 38:08.640
to find someone I feel comfortable talking to.

405
38:12.320 --> 38:13.680
Me?

406
38:17.320 --> 38:19.200
Go ahead, then, Your Highness.

407
38:30.800 --> 38:33.320
It's about your mother and brother, isn't it?

408
38:36.560 --> 38:37.160
How did you know?

409
38:37.160 --> 38:39.680
At Maneethip's bedding ceremony,

410
38:39.680 --> 38:43.520
I noticed Prince Mueang Fah sitting on the opposite side,

411
38:43.520 --> 38:47.640
rather than beside Royal Consort Sukantha, like you did.

412
38:47.640 --> 38:50.360
And ever since Prince Mueang Fah returned to Ullavee,

413
38:50.360 --> 38:52.560
he has spent his nights at Wat Singhasna

414
38:52.560 --> 38:55.560
instead of at Royal Consort Sukantha's residence.

415
38:55.560 --> 38:58.400
And I once saw...

416
38:58.400 --> 39:02.920
Prince Mueang Fah rowing a boat alone and picking lotus flowers at Wat Singhasna.

417
39:02.920 --> 39:06.040
- He looked terribly lonely, Your Highness. - Nosy.

418
39:06.040 --> 39:10.120
- And you're quite the nosy one yourself. - Senior!

419
39:10.120 --> 39:13.360
You'd better call it being observant.

420
39:13.360 --> 39:17.600
I need to learn these things if I'm going to survive here.

421
39:19.000 --> 39:23.120
Are you afraid of Mueang Fah, too, like everyone else?

422
39:25.840 --> 39:29.960
I have my own reasons for being afraid of him.

423
39:31.040 --> 39:34.960
So why is everyone else afraid of him?

424
39:40.240 --> 39:44.400
Have you ever heard of the "Hour of the Plunderer"?

425
39:49.400 --> 39:54.960
It is the hour in which a destroyer is born,

426
39:54.960 --> 39:57.560
one believed to bring calamity upon the realm.

427
39:58.880 --> 40:00.720
Mueang Fah...

428
40:02.640 --> 40:04.640
was born in the Hour of the Plunderer.

429
40:06.080 --> 40:09.000
That is why he was exiled to the border at a young age.

430
40:10.720 --> 40:12.800
Mother cannot let go of the belief...

431
40:12.800 --> 40:17.640
that Mueang Fah is the reason she never became Queen.

432
40:24.200 --> 40:26.320
I felt sorry for him,

433
40:27.240 --> 40:33.080
but back then I was too young to do anything to help.

434
40:36.360 --> 40:37.880
Senior.

435
40:39.560 --> 40:42.480
You're such a kind person.

436
40:43.720 --> 40:47.520
You worry so much about others that you feel unhappy.

437
40:48.760 --> 40:53.280
But being unhappy won't solve anything.

438
40:55.360 --> 40:59.840
Some things are just beyond our control.

439
41:00.920 --> 41:03.040
If you ask me,

440
41:03.720 --> 41:08.560
the only thing you can do is take good care of yourself.

441
41:09.680 --> 41:14.160
Because you'll be looking after those two for a long time to come.

442
41:16.480 --> 41:20.960
Neither of them is likely to back down.

443
41:22.920 --> 41:28.640
Someone who can't swim shouldn't try to save someone who's drowning.

444
41:35.320 --> 41:36.800
Well said!

445
41:39.320 --> 41:43.480
Junior, you really know how to cheer me up.

446
41:44.360 --> 41:50.280
Now, I hope you'll stay safe in Wiang Kaew.

447
41:51.560 --> 41:54.720
Mueang Fah is also making his way to Wiang Kaew.

448
41:54.720 --> 41:57.960
I'll ask him to look after you.

449
41:57.960 --> 42:02.160
No, Your Highness. I don't need anyone looking after me.

450
42:03.200 --> 42:05.360
I can take care of myself.

451
42:09.120 --> 42:14.120
If you really want to help me, then help me with something else.

452
42:15.080 --> 42:16.440
What is it?

453
42:30.320 --> 42:33.080
This room has been specially prepared for you.

454
42:33.080 --> 42:37.400
You may rest here at ease.

455
42:43.560 --> 42:49.520
Has the new lady-in-waiting whom Homjan assigned to serve Father arrived yet?

456
42:50.800 --> 42:51.880
Yes, Your Highness.

457
42:53.600 --> 42:55.920
Today is her first day as well.

458
43:24.960 --> 43:27.600
This is your accommodation.

459
43:27.600 --> 43:32.760
You'll be staying here from now on. You must learn to adjust.

460
43:32.760 --> 43:34.280
Yes, my lady.

461
43:34.280 --> 43:36.520
Tidy your belongings.

462
43:37.400 --> 43:40.440
You shall present yourself before the King tomorrow.

463
43:40.440 --> 43:42.520
Tomorrow already?

464
43:42.520 --> 43:44.240
Yes.

465
43:44.240 --> 43:46.160
Be prepared.

466
44:02.480 --> 44:07.360
Dao Kaew has returned from Wang Nam Lin with the information you wish to find.

467
44:07.360 --> 44:09.160
What did she find out?

468
44:10.840 --> 44:13.640
Let me ask you once more.

469
44:14.440 --> 44:20.080
Are you still determined to learn about Princess Maneethip's past, Your Highness?

470
44:33.440 --> 44:35.320
I'm prepared to hear it all.

471
44:37.320 --> 44:39.160
Tell me everything.

472
44:41.880 --> 44:47.680
Princess Maneethip did have a lover, just as you suspected.

473
44:57.440 --> 45:02.920
She and General In Saeng had been close since childhood.

474
45:03.720 --> 45:09.600
He served as her royal guard and taught her everything.

475
45:09.600 --> 45:14.160
He was also the person she trusted most.

476
45:15.720 --> 45:18.040
As they grew older,

477
45:18.040 --> 45:23.640
their bond grew into love.

478
45:25.040 --> 45:29.160
Once the royal proposal for Princess Maneethip was sent,

479
45:30.480 --> 45:34.160
General In Saeng was sent away to the border,

480
45:34.760 --> 45:40.200
so he wouldn't stand between you and the princess.

481
46:08.160 --> 46:10.240
Do not grieve, my princess.

482
46:12.640 --> 46:14.440
I understand.

483
46:15.480 --> 46:19.880
We both have duties to fulfill for our realm.

484
46:25.640 --> 46:31.480
In this life, fate may not allow us to be together,

485
46:33.280 --> 46:34.880
but this love...

486
46:36.840 --> 46:39.280
shall remain in my heart...

487
46:41.760 --> 46:43.280
forever.

488
47:00.640 --> 47:02.440
These orchids...

489
47:04.520 --> 47:06.840
will bloom in my heart...

490
47:11.360 --> 47:13.880
until my dying breath.

491
48:12.640 --> 48:13.880
Hyah!

492
48:21.320 --> 48:22.600
Hyah!

493
48:49.520 --> 48:51.760
I never knew any of this.

494
48:52.880 --> 48:54.600
Had I known,

495
48:55.640 --> 48:59.760
I would never have asked Father to send a royal proposal for her hand.

496
48:59.760 --> 49:03.360
No outsiders knew, Your Highness.

497
49:03.360 --> 49:05.800
The King of Wang Nam Lin...

498
49:06.680 --> 49:10.600
ordered that the matter be kept secret.

499
49:14.360 --> 49:16.080
So now,

500
49:18.080 --> 49:20.280
what became of General In Saeng?

501
49:42.920 --> 49:45.840
Your Highness! Your Highness!

502
49:47.040 --> 49:49.600
Why did you rush in like that? What is it, Lha?

503
49:51.360 --> 49:55.560
A messenger from Wang Nam Lin has arrived with news from the soldiers.

504
49:57.360 --> 49:58.960
What news?

505
50:03.360 --> 50:05.120
What's in that pouch, Lha?

506
50:09.840 --> 50:11.200
Lha.

507
50:41.440 --> 50:43.200
Lha, what is the news?

508
50:48.040 --> 50:49.840
What happened to In Saeng?

509
50:54.680 --> 50:56.680
Lha, tell me at once!

510
51:02.640 --> 51:04.680
General In Saeng...

511
51:06.400 --> 51:10.640
died two days ago from jungle fever while stationed at the border.

512
51:19.000 --> 51:24.040
This news should reach Princess Maneethip soon.

513
51:53.360 --> 51:55.520
With his dying breath,

514
51:57.320 --> 51:59.440
General In Saeng asked his men

515
51:59.440 --> 52:02.200
to deliver this head cloth to you, Princess Maneethip.

516
52:29.320 --> 52:30.840
This is all because of me.

517
52:33.720 --> 52:36.200
If I hadn't taken Maneethip away from him,

518
52:40.440 --> 52:43.720
General In Saeng would never have been sent to the border...

519
52:48.480 --> 52:50.440
and he wouldn't have died this way.

520
52:52.440 --> 52:57.560
Humans cannot defy the fate decreed by Heaven.

521
52:58.640 --> 53:03.600
Whether it be love...

522
53:04.920 --> 53:07.000
or death.

523
53:32.640 --> 53:34.280
Why?

524
53:40.360 --> 53:42.160
In this life,

525
53:43.040 --> 53:46.240
fate may not allow us to be together,

526
53:47.280 --> 53:48.840
but this love...

527
53:50.800 --> 53:53.280
shall remain in my heart...

528
53:55.680 --> 53:57.280
forever.

529
54:05.960 --> 54:07.680
Why couldn't it have been me who died instead?

530
54:07.680 --> 54:10.880
Princess Maneethip, please don't do this!

531
54:12.480 --> 54:14.800
Please don't. Your Highness.

532
54:21.880 --> 54:24.040
Because of me...

533
54:28.240 --> 54:33.040
In Saeng died because of me.

534
54:37.280 --> 54:39.640
I'd like to tell you.

535
54:41.280 --> 54:43.480
I didn't come here...

536
54:45.440 --> 54:49.880
out of ambition or greed.

537
54:51.440 --> 54:56.320
I know that if I disobey the royal decree,

538
54:56.320 --> 54:59.160
those around me will suffer the consequences.

539
55:00.160 --> 55:02.040
I don't want my sister...

540
55:02.040 --> 55:05.160
or Prince Saen Thep to get dragged into trouble because of me.

541
55:06.080 --> 55:08.800
I will do my best to fulfill my duties.

542
55:08.800 --> 55:13.280
And if I ever make a mistake, please punish me.

543
55:14.600 --> 55:17.960
Don't let others suffer for my mistakes.

544
55:17.960 --> 55:23.280
I have no desire for grand titles or special privileges.

545
55:24.800 --> 55:27.880
I simply want to perform my duties to the best of my ability...

546
55:29.000 --> 55:32.040
and make it through each day safely.

547
55:41.040 --> 55:44.200
Don't you think you're asking for too little?

548
55:44.200 --> 55:49.440
Being too ambitious will only bring trouble.

549
55:51.080 --> 55:54.800
No human plan can defy the will of Heaven.

550
55:54.800 --> 55:58.720
Sometimes, you may be forced to accept things you never wanted.

551
55:58.720 --> 56:00.960
Leave that for the future.

552
56:00.960 --> 56:05.440
There's no use worrying about things that haven't happened yet.

553
56:06.080 --> 56:10.200
I will respect your wishes.

554
56:10.200 --> 56:14.320
But my wishes, you must follow.

555
56:14.320 --> 56:17.440
Now, tidy your belongings and get ready.

556
56:17.440 --> 56:20.360
We must present ourselves before the King tomorrow.

557
56:20.360 --> 56:21.600
Yes, my lady.

558
57:31.120 --> 57:33.000
[Next Episode] What you must help me with,

559
57:33.000 --> 57:36.320
besides hand-rolling tobacco, is serving tea.

560
57:36.320 --> 57:39.640
Lady Homjan and Fongnuan are here to serve you, Your Majesty.

561
57:39.640 --> 57:43.960
If I accidentally hurt the King, will I be executed?

562
57:43.960 --> 57:47.480
Why must I keep an eye on Fongnuan? She's merely a lady-in-waiting.

563
57:47.480 --> 57:49.040
She hardly seems like a threat.

564
57:49.040 --> 57:50.600
Given the circumstances,

565
57:50.600 --> 57:54.360
you should know what you ought and ought not to do.

566
57:54.360 --> 57:57.360
If I had to choose between falling in love and catching bandits,

567
57:57.360 --> 57:59.000
I'd much rather go after bandits.

568
57:59.000 --> 58:02.560
I thank you on Maneethip's behalf.

569
58:02.560 --> 58:06.320
I shall devote myself to caring for Maneethip to the best of my ability.
